{"id":"vod_bf_35499","vodId":"35499","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"伪恋第一季","name_cn":"伪恋第一季","date":"2014-01-01","year":"2014","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-36/225be2328ef8e82297473db889f6154b.jpg"},"summary":"自称有着大众脸的高中生一条乐（内山昂辉 配音），其实是著名流氓帮派“集英组”头目的独子，他本想过上平凡人的生活，直到一个美少女转校生桐崎千棘（东山奈央 配音）的出现，他们的命运自此向不可预料的方向发展。　　这位金发碧眼的混血儿转校生，原来是美国黑帮“蜂巢”老大的千金，为了双方家族能和睦相处，一条乐和千棘必须假装成一对恋人。个性不合的二人，心不甘情不愿地开始了他们的“甜蜜”生活。在打打闹闹的交往中，千棘渐渐喜欢上了一条乐，而一条乐却一直暗恋着同班女生小野寺（花泽香菜 配音），但因为各种原因无法与之心意相通。这对校园三角恋，因为黑帮和警察的介入，越发不受控制……","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-04-29 22:46:40","playable":true,"episodeCount":20,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/weiliandiyiji/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/weiliandiyiji/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/weiliandiyiji/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/weiliandiyiji/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/weiliandiyiji/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/weiliandiyiji/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/weiliandiyiji/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/weiliandiyiji/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/weiliandiyiji/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/weiliandiyiji/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/weiliandiyiji/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/weiliandiyiji/第12集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/weiliandiyiji/第13集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/weiliandiyiji/第14集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第1